{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05、S13等段未标“到时出现”的感受词仍然偏密，部分意象重复或过满，容易分散注意力；X在这方面更克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成较短的句子，并用放大加亮的关键词突出每段心理重点，观众更容易抓住人物当下的念头及其变化。它对音乐起伏、身体反应和细微情绪的对应也更具体，尤其从怕给对方负担，到怕失去亲近，再到不再索求永远的保证，心理发展有清楚的递进。扫屏效率上，Y的短句和重点突出有优势，但X的左右分栏与较少的感受词也更清爽，因此这一项打平。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a2eeec47-206e-4c6e-bd7f-ac19410ddf01", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T001657949231Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:18:27.654969+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "19d162cb352220ed4867df9cc151df86d56970485f6568ff630ba818151f24a2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py"